Scope of this repository
------------------------

This repository contains the blockchain and wallet-control portion of MeowWa only: multi-chain
descriptors, wallet provisioning and wallet-control policy, USDC transfer and balance readers,
receive indexing, merchant reconciliation, onramp funding, purchase intents, and the deterministic
spending policy gate. That code is licensed to you under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as set
